INT: So your mother went with your father?

LD: No, my father, they took him in the army, and my mother took the kids, and she was gone with the kids.

INT: She went-- followed the Russian army.

LD: Absolutely, yeah. Which-- nobody know where is going. But no one know. Nobody know.

